<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon on oil companies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon on oil companies.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Cross Timbers Oil Co and Devon Energy Corp with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- said set a 12-month price target of $23 a share for Cross Timbers and a $42 target for Devon.</p>
<p>-- said started Ocean Energy Inc as a strong buy and set a 12-month price target of $67 a share.</p>
<p>-- said started Pogo Producing Co as a hold with a $45 price target.</p>
</text>
